      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "info-box",
          "html": "<p>Así como hay dos íes, hay <strong>dos úes</strong>: <span class=\"gu\">ઉ</span> es corta (<strong>u</strong>) y <span class=\"gu\">ઊ</span> es larga (<strong>uu</strong>). Su matra <span class=\"gu\">ૂ</span> se escribe <strong>debajo</strong> de la consonante: <span class=\"gu\">પ</span> + <span class=\"gu\">ૂ</span> = <span class=\"gu\">પૂ</span> (puu).</p><br><p>Y una conjuntiva nueva: <span class=\"gu\">શ</span> + <span class=\"gu\">વ</span> = <span class=\"gu\">શ્વ</span> (<strong>shv</strong>), como en <span class=\"gu\">વિશ્વ</span> (mundo).</p>"
